sequenceDiagram
  actor Usuario
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant GW as API Gateway/BFF
  participant ORD as ms-order
  participant DBORD as PostgreSQL orderdb
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant INV as ms-inventory
  participant DBINV as PostgreSQL inventory
  participant SHIP as ms-shipping
  participant NOTIF as ms-notification

  Usuario->>FE: Completa formulario de orden
  FE->>GW: POST /smartlogix/order/orders + Bearer JWT
  GW->>GW: Valida JWT y obtiene companyId
  GW->>ORD: POST /orders con X-Company-Id
  ORD->>DBORD: Persiste Order y OrderItem
  ORD->>MQ: Publica OrderCreated
  ORD-->>GW: 201 Pedido creado
  GW-->>FE: Respuesta con pedido
  MQ-->>INV: Consume OrderCreated
  INV->>DBINV: Reserva stock
  INV->>MQ: Publica ReservationConfirmed o ReservationFailed
  MQ-->>SHIP: Consume ReservationConfirmed
  SHIP->>SHIP: Crea envio asociado
  SHIP->>MQ: Publica eventos de despacho
  MQ-->>NOTIF: Consume eventos de orden/despacho
  NOTIF->>NOTIF: Crea notificacion y correo
